Problem: Execute a rolling update for nginx-deployment integrating the nginx:1.18 image. Ensure all pods are operational.

Solution:

bash
# Get the container name
kubectl get deployment nginx-deployment -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.containers[*].name}'

# Update the image
kubectl set image deployment/nginx-deployment nginx-container=nginx:1.18

# Watch rollout
kubectl rollout status deployment/nginx-deployment

# Verify
kubectl get pods -l app=nginx
